# Notifications Center – UI Implementation Rule

## Objective

Build the Notifications Center page for the Ashraf Courier Business Platform, providing centralized notification management with delivery alerts, system updates, and customizable preferences. **No backend logic or API integration—focus is on layout, navigation, and user experience.**

---

## 1. Technology & Design System

- **Framework:** Next.js 14+ (App Router)
- **Language:** TypeScript
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS only
- **UI Components:** shadcn/ui (https://ui.shadcn.com/)
- **State Management:** Zustand (for client-side state, if needed)
- **Transitions:** Use premium, subtle transitions as per premium-transitions-and-effects.mdc
- **Accessibility:** All UI must be accessible (ARIA, keyboard navigation, color contrast)

---

## 2. Scope & Requirements

### Notifications Center Features (All UI, No Backend)
- **Notification List:** Chronological list of all notifications with unread indicators
- **Category Filtering:** Filter by type (shipments, system, billing, announcements)
- **Priority Levels:** Visual indicators for high, normal, and low priority
- **Bulk Actions:** Mark all as read, clear all, delete selected
- **Search & Filter:** Search notifications by content, date range, or type
- **Notification Preferences:** Customize delivery channels and frequency
- **Real-time Updates:** Mock real-time notification delivery
- **Export Options:** Download notification history (mock)

---

## 3. Page Structure & Layout

### Header Section
- **Page Title:** "Notifications Center" with notification count badge
- **Action Buttons:** Mark all as read, Clear all, Settings
- **Search Bar:** Full-width search with filters dropdown
- **View Toggle:** List view vs. Compact view

### Filter Bar
- **Category Tabs:** All, Shipments, System, Billing, Announcements
- **Date Range:** Today, Last 7 days, Last 30 days, Custom
- **Priority Filter:** High, Normal, Low
- **Status Filter:** Unread, Read, All

### Notification List
- **Notification Items:** Each with type icon, title, preview, timestamp, priority badge
- **Unread Indicators:** Bold text, colored left border, unread badge
- **Action Buttons:** Mark as read, Dismiss, View details
- **Grouping:** Group by date (Today, Yesterday, This week, Earlier)

### Sidebar (Optional)
- **Quick Stats:** Unread count, Today's notifications
- **Quick Actions:** Create shipment, Track package
- **Recent Activity:** Last 5 notifications preview

---

## 4. Notification Types & Categories

### Shipment Notifications
- **Status Updates:** Label created, scanned, out for delivery, delivered
- **Delivery Alerts:** Failed delivery, retry attempts, proof of delivery
- **Route Changes:** ETA updates, location changes, courier assignments

### System Notifications
- **Platform Updates:** New features, maintenance windows, policy changes
- **Account Alerts:** Verification required, security notices, login attempts
- **Performance Updates:** System status, API changes, integration updates

### Billing Notifications
- **Payment Confirmations:** Successful payments, failed charges
- **Invoice Alerts:** New invoices, payment due reminders
- **Billing Changes:** Rate updates, plan changes, credit adjustments

### Announcements
- **Feature Releases:** New capabilities, beta programs
- **Business Updates:** Company news, partnership announcements
- **Educational Content:** Tips, best practices, case studies

