## 7. State Management

### Local State
- **Notifications List:** Array of notification objects
- **Filters:** Current filter selections (category, date, priority, status)
- **Search Query:** Current search term
- **View Mode:** List vs. Compact view
- **Selected Items:** Array of selected notification IDs for bulk actions

### State Updates
- **Mark as Read:** Update notification status locally
- **Dismiss:** Remove notification from list
- **Bulk Actions:** Apply actions to multiple notifications
- **Filter Changes:** Re-filter notifications based on selections
- **Search:** Filter notifications by search term

---

## 8. User Interactions & Behaviors

### Notification Actions
- **Click Notification:** Navigate to related page or show details modal
- **Mark as Read:** Update status, remove unread indicator
- **Dismiss:** Remove from list with confirmation
- **Bulk Selection:** Checkbox selection for multiple notifications

### Filtering & Search
- **Real-time Search:** Filter as user types
- **Category Tabs:** Switch between notification types
- **Date Range:** Filter by time period
- **Priority Filter:** Show only specific priority levels

### Responsive Behavior
- **Mobile:** Stack layout, collapsible filters, touch-friendly actions
- **Tablet:** Side-by-side layout with collapsible sidebar
- **Desktop:** Full layout with persistent sidebar

---

## 9. Navigation & Routing

### Page Route
- **Path:** `/notifications`
- **Access:** From dashboard notification bell, profile settings, or direct URL

### Internal Navigation
- **Shipment Details:** Navigate to `/shipments/{id}`
- **Billing:** Navigate to `/billing`
- **Settings:** Navigate to `/profile` notifications tab
- **Back to Dashboard:** Breadcrumb or back button

---

## 10. Accessibility Requirements

### ARIA Labels
- **Notification Items:** `aria-label="Notification: {title}"`
- **Action Buttons:** `aria-label="{action} notification"`
- **Filter Controls:** `aria-label="Filter by {category}"`
- **Search Input:** `aria-label="Search notifications"`

### Keyboard Navigation
- **Tab Order:** Logical flow through all interactive elements
- **Arrow Keys:** Navigate between notification items
- **Enter/Space:** Activate buttons and actions
- **Escape:** Close modals and return to list

### Screen Reader Support
- **Live Regions:** Announce new notifications and status changes
- **Status Updates:** Announce filter changes and search results
- **Action Confirmations:** Announce successful actions

---

## 11. Performance & UX Considerations

### Loading States
- **Initial Load:** Skeleton loading for notification list
- **Search Results:** Loading indicator during search
- **Bulk Actions:** Progress indicator for multiple operations

### Pagination & Virtualization
- **Lazy Loading:** Load notifications in chunks
- **Infinite Scroll:** Load more as user scrolls
- **Virtual Scrolling:** For large notification lists (1000+ items)

### Transitions & Animations
- **Entrance Animations:** Staggered notification appearance
- **Status Changes:** Smooth transitions for read/unread states
- **Filter Changes:** Smooth list updates with fade effects

---

## 12. Error Handling & Edge Cases

### Empty States
- **No Notifications:** Friendly message with CTA to create shipment
- **No Search Results:** Clear message with search suggestions
- **Filtered Results Empty:** Show all notifications option

### Error States
- **Load Failures:** Retry button with error message
- **Action Failures:** Toast notifications for failed operations
- **Network Issues:** Offline indicator with cached notifications

---

## 13. Testing & Validation

### Functionality Testing
- **Filter Combinations:** Test all filter combinations work correctly
- **Search Accuracy:** Verify search finds relevant notifications
- **Bulk Actions:** Test mark all as read, clear all, delete selected
- **Navigation:** Verify all navigation links work correctly

### Accessibility Testing
- **Screen Reader:** Test with NVDA, JAWS, VoiceOver
- **Keyboard Navigation:** Test all interactions without mouse
- **Color Contrast:** Verify WCAG AA compliance
- **Reduced Motion:** Test with prefers-reduced-motion

### Performance Testing
- **Large Lists:** Test with 1000+ notifications
- **Search Performance:** Test search with large datasets
- **Memory Usage:** Monitor memory consumption during operations

